<p style="-uslm-lc:I11" class="indent0">There are hereby authorized to be appropriated such sums, but not more than $193,233 as may be necessary to carry out the provisions of sections 111c to 111e of this title.</p>
</content><sourceCredit id="id0b4381a4-810c-11f1-b7ce-bdea3d14cbdd">(<ref href="/us/pl/88/235/s3">Pub. L. 88–235, § 3</ref>, <date date="1963-12-23">Dec. 23, 1963</date>, <ref href="/us/stat/77/474">77 Stat. 474</ref>; <ref href="/us/pl/94/578/tI/s101/8">Pub. L. 94–578, title I, § 101(8)</ref>, <date date="1976-10-21">Oct. 21, 1976</date>, <ref href="/us/stat/90/2732">90 Stat. 2732</ref>.)</sourceCredit>
